# nowen-note
===
 An open source self-hosted knowledge base that puts notes, diaries, and tasks together and puts the data under your control. Use Markdown or rich text to record, you can write even if you are offline, and it will be automatically synchronized when you are online. Supports AI knowledge question and answer, MCP access and Docker, NAS deployment. , An open-source, self-hosted knowledge base for notes, journals, and tasks. Write offline in Markdown or rich text, sync across devices, and ask AI about your notes. Supports MCP and Docker/NAS..
